Hi

Not really a bug but I thought I'd add some information in case someone runs into the situation in the future. 

By default the plugin only registers one rewrite rule for the registration endpoint, so that you can add a plan into the URL like /register/premium/ .  If you would like to add another page or have a multi-language site the second URL would not be working with the plan segment.

You can fix this by registering your own rewrite rules:

```

add_action('init', function () {
    add_rewrite_rule(
        "(nl)/register\/([0-9a-zA-Z-_]+)[\/]?$",
        'index.php?lang=$matches[1]&pagename=register&products[]=$matches[2]&wu_preselected=products',
        'top'
    );
}, 20);
```
